      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-48-59"><seg source="#source-48-59">重吉</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-59-73"><seg source="#source-59-73">ひろ子</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-73-87"><seg source="#source-73-87">富井</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-87-101"><seg source="#source-87-101">行雄</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 6em" rend="first-line-indent(6)" source="#source-101-136"><seg source="#source-101-136">伸一　健吉</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-136-152"><seg source="#source-136-152">小枝</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-152-208"><seg source="#source-152-208">永田弁護士　　　　村上さん（鈴）</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 11em" rend="first-line-indent(11)" source="#source-208-264"><seg source="#source-208-264">清瀬さん（近）</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-264-293"><seg source="#source-264-293">┌───────┐</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-293-322"><seg source="#source-293-322">│　山代弁護士　│</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-322-372"><seg source="#source-322-372">│　上野駅　　　│　　吉岡（佐）</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-372-401"><seg source="#source-372-401">│　事務所　　　│</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-401-430"><seg source="#source-401-430">└───────┘</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-430-459"><seg source="#source-430-459">十三日　十四日</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-459-473"><seg source="#source-459-473">電報</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-473-508"><seg source="#source-473-508">海よ早くしずまれ。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-508-531"><seg source="#source-508-531">〔欄外に〕</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-531-605"><seg source="#source-531-605">┌───────────────┐　　</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-605-673"><seg source="#source-605-673">│　あらゆるものごしの初々しさ　│</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-673-741"><seg source="#source-673-741">│　一直線　　　　　　　　　　　│</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-741-811"><seg source="#source-741-811">└───────────────┘</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-811-849"><seg source="#source-811-849">┌─────────┐</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-849-905"><seg source="#source-849-905">│　目白の家｜物干し│　巣鴨の夏）</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-905-943"><seg source="#source-905-943">└─────────┘</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-943-1002"><seg source="#source-943-1002">自立会　畑の中の家　赤旗一号への感情</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1002-1043"><seg source="#source-1002-1043">電気溶接学校ときいてゆく</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1043-1069"><seg source="#source-1043-1069">アカハタ編輯局</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-1069-1137"><seg source="#source-1069-1137">あのベンチ　経歴書を出すかい？（前後）</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1137-1157"><seg source="#source-1137-1157">〔欄外に〕</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-1157-1183"><seg source="#source-1157-1183">ニュース</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-1183-1235"><seg source="#source-1183-1235">一人かえって来る重吉の姿</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-1235-1261"><seg source="#source-1235-1261">┌あの二階</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1261-1302"><seg source="#source-1261-1302">大会┤のびかかった髪の毛</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-1302-1347"><seg source="#source-1302-1347">└　二百人の人でぎっしり</seg></p>
    </body>
